{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/A-20260819ChineseValentine_sDay_PengChau-17-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/B-20260819ChineseValentine_sDay_PengChau-10-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/C-20260819ChineseValentine_sDay_PengChau-09-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<p>現負責打理廟務的周家後人英姐（化名）向攝影記者透露，當年其蜑家漁民爺爺出海時，意外撈獲一尊「四姊」木雕。爺爺將木雕帶回家，送給年幼的英姐當玩具，她更為雕像縫製衣裳。未料英姐隨後發高燒病倒，嫲嫲更獲「七姊」報夢，叮囑爺爺見廟供奉。周家遂遵從神諭，建成了今日的七姊廟。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/D-20260819ChineseValentine_sDay_PengChau-23-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/E-20260819ChineseValentine_sDay_PengChau-25-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/F-20260819ChineseValentine_sDay_PengChau-11-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<p>仙姐廟以求姻緣靈驗著稱，英姐更分享了一段浪漫小插曲。三年前的七月初六傍晚，一名帶點「Baby Fat」的微胖男，在廟前苦候至七月初七子時參拜，翌年亦如是。直至昨日初六晚，該男生身穿紅衣，牽著女友前來還願。英姐起初沒為意，直到他拉著女友的手，尷尬地對著英姐一笑，英姐才認出這位癡情男，見證良緣開花結果。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/G-20260819ChineseValentine_sDay_PengChau-02-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/H-20260819ChineseValentine_sDay_PengChau-04-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<p>談到七姊廟拜神心得，英姐認為其實就是跟神靈溝通：「有咩就直接講，將煩惱講畀七姊聽。」當「傾計」一樣，若想知道七姊的建議與結果，擲聖杯便可。在七夕佳節，仙姐廟不僅是求賜良緣的聖地，更是信眾傾訴心聲的避風港。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/I-20260819ChineseValentine_sDay_PengChau-05-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/J-20260819ChineseValentine_sDay_PengChau-27-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Payme-500x237.png\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-20T02:20:43.223740+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":386,"images":11,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"none"}}